---
---
<section class="bg-navy-darker py-[80px] px-6 md:px-16 border-t border-navy-mid">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-16 md:w-2/3">
      <span class="font-mono text-primary text-xs uppercase tracking-[1px] block mb-4">Process</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-[44px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.4px] text-canvas mb-4">
        How We Work
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-ink-secondary text-lg">
        From first sketch to ongoing maintenance — one team, start to finish.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-8">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="font-display text-gold-accent text-3xl mb-4">01</div>
        <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-canvas text-[18px] mb-2">Design</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-secondary text-sm">We assess your site and requirements, then design a structure that fits both the space and the brief.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="font-display text-gold-accent text-3xl mb-4">02</div>
        <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-canvas text-[18px] mb-2">Manufacturing</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-secondary text-sm">Every structure is fabricated to order, using fabric sourced from trusted international partners.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="font-display text-gold-accent text-3xl mb-4">03</div>
        <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-canvas text-[18px] mb-2">Installation</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-secondary text-sm">Our own technical teams install on-site, coordinated directly with our design and manufacturing teams.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="font-display text-gold-accent text-3xl mb-4">04</div>
        <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-canvas text-[18px] mb-2">Maintenance</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-secondary text-sm">Shade structures take punishment from the sun and wind. We keep existing structures in working condition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="font-display text-gold-accent text-3xl mb-4">05</div>
        <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-canvas text-[18px] mb-2">Fix / Renovation</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-secondary text-sm">Repairing and renovating existing tents, shades, and sheds, not just building new ones.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
